{"schemaVersion":"galpedia-static-detail-model-v1","dataRevision":"a0c0367b8270b080feef0ef1fe65522144dc62343feb9d752729d92867d0d639","workId":"29235","model":{"presentationWorkId":"egs:29235","staff":{"artwork":[],"scenario":[],"music":[],"other":[]},"cast":[{"characterId":"char_bangumi_104591","characterName":"Kamitsure","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"104591","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"8641"},{"characterId":"104591","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"8642"}]},"originalCharacterName":"Kamitsure","characterNameSource":null,"role":"配角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"小菊儿在《黑／白》和《黑２／白２》中作为雷文道馆的道馆馆主，馆主称号为“闪亮美人（暂译，日文︰シャイニング　ビューティ）。雷文道馆也是合众地区的第四个道馆，打败她的训练家会收到伏特徽章和招式学习器７２（伏特替换）。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"小菊儿初次登场就帮助白露，说服白露的爸爸来让她成为宝可梦训练家和继续旅行。之后会在最后时刻和芦荟、亚堤、菊老大、风露、哈奇库、夏卡和艾莉丝赶到Ｎ的城堡支援主角，和七贤人对峙。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"在《黑２／白２》中，小菊儿也会在继续担任道馆馆主，她的头发变成黑色；耳机也变成竖立的天线，并且带有可伸缩的眼镜；服饰也发生了变化；并增加了伙伴茸茸羊。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"小菊儿参加了宝可梦世界锦标赛，她参加了帆巴锦标赛、混合锦标赛、合众馆主赛、世界馆主赛、属性专家赛以及混合大师赛。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"104591"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/70/7016fe8626345e4b5e931134b0372f1426fcc8b9faccfb12bf544c4442dbe6aa.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/db/dbfdde5320bd598064310f6461335b306c4450fa9cdae99a81cc3b1f81dc8464.webp","width":183,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_105795","characterName":"Ingo","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"105795","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"329302"},{"characterId":"105795","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"8641"},{"characterId":"105795","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"8642"}]},"originalCharacterName":"Ingo","characterNameSource":null,"role":"配角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"《黑／白》和《黑２／白２》：对战地铁的其中一名首领。他和胞弟南厦一同担任地铁总管。在《黑／白》和《黑２／白２》中可以在绿线和深绿线同北尚进行单打对战，以及在橙线和黄线同他和南厦进行多人对战。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"《传说 阿尔宙斯》：北尚在《传说 阿尔宙斯》再次登场。他是偶然间来到洗翠地区的场长，隶属于珍珠队。负责照顾大狃拉。任务过程中北尚会告诉主角，他与主角一样同为穿越者，因为未知原因穿越到了洗翠地区。并且丧失了除名字之外几乎所有的记忆。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"105795"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f5/f5d568971aeb47aa8b80da96c0831cb6a2920771bed579bbb518b7fc43291ca4.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f4/f40d0d6019708be8e7f82186651e23bb937f6968591fe05a29eefce23d146226.webp","width":191,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_126491","characterName":"Natural・Harmonia・Gropius","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"126491","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"8641"},{"characterId":"126491","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"8642"}]},"originalCharacterName":"Natural・Harmonia・Gropius","characterNameSource":null,"role":"主角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"180"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"N，全名纳秋然·哈尔孟尼亚·格罗皮乌斯（暂译，日文︰ナチュラル・ハルモニア・グロピウス，英文︰Natural Harmonia Gropius），是游戏《宝可梦黑・白》中的一位重要角色，他将宝可梦称作朋友，并希望将宝可梦与人类像黑与白一样分离开来。智商非常高，被称作“数学的魔术师”，可以看到人的过去及未来。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"据说是宝可梦所生的人类，很爱宝可梦，和人类保持距离。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"认为自己是完全的存在，因为疏远人类而被人类所畏惧，所以与宝可梦有着非常紧密的关系。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"根据黑白版本的不同，他会分别成为与主角相对应的理想的追求者(宝可梦白版)或者真实的追求者(宝可梦黑版)，驾驭捷克罗姆或莱希拉姆。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"增田顺一在宝可梦中心超级东京店举办的《宝可梦究极之日/究极之月》粉丝见面会上提到，N懂社会学，且大脑比电脑还快。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"126491"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/eb/eb70f6d26722d5d1913a554c7cee2a6983ad443a9030348dd65807afffe22143.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/cc/ccc3bcc11533a121306f54dbdd81479dfdb30530f71b3a29ab17612d22b6eb34.webp","width":161,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_14222","characterName":"Iris","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"14222","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"8641"},{"characterId":"14222","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"8642"}]},"originalCharacterName":"Iris","characterNameSource":null,"role":"配角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"游戏中"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"艾莉丝在黑版／白版中首次登场。她在飞云市初次露面，帮助主角打败等离子队，夺回白露的食梦梦。之后她接受白露的请求，帮助白露做宝可梦对战特训。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主角之后会在双龙市再次遇到艾莉丝，她与夏卡一起向主角诉说合众地区的建国传说。在小波镇的竹兰别墅中她也会出现。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"在白版中，她是合众地区第八个道馆——双龙道馆的道馆馆主。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"在黑版中，她负责教授主角亲密度最高的龙属性宝可梦流星群。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"在黑版2／白版2中，她成为了冠军，发型和服装也有所变化，也同样会在飞云市初次登场，带主角来到飞云地下水道入口。在主角和修打败等离子队后，她建议主角去挑战飞云道馆后就会离开。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"艾莉丝会在双龙市再次登场，在得知主角会挑战双龙道馆时，她会告诉主角夏卡是和她没有血缘关系的爷爷。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"动画中"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"《超级愿望》"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"在精灵宝可梦 超级愿望中，艾莉丝作为小智的旅行同伴登场，此外小智的另一位旅行同伴是天桐。艾莉丝是个野性少女，她喜欢荡摇在藤蔓，也喜欢吃浆果。旅行的时候，她宝可梦以及朋友牙牙不躲在精灵球里，而隐藏在她头发中。艾莉丝非常活跃，她有时会在树迅速地爬树，她也喜欢冒险，并且很大胆。她也手脚灵活，如在水水獭！黑眼鳄！危在旦夕!!中她救了小智，使他没有倒在酷热的水中。艾莉丝也非常喜欢可爱的宝可梦，她首次看到小智的皮卡丘，就紧紧地抱住它。跟小刚一样，她也会做药，跟小霞一样，她也觉得小智是个孩子，喜欢对小智说“真是小孩子…”（日文：子供ね）。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"她还很害怕冰属性宝可梦，因为龙属性被冰属性克制。她每次见到冰属性宝可梦都会打冷颤。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"《世代》"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"在宝可梦世代的叛乱中，艾莉丝和赤面龙误入等离子队举行仪式的神殿，艾莉丝便让赤面龙阻止七贤人，正在这时遭到了酷豹们的攻击，被及时赶到的菊老大救下。之后她与陆续前来支援的合众地区其他的道馆馆主在夏卡的带领下向等离子队发起进攻。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"漫画中"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"特别篇的艾莉丝是一位天真调皮的少女，有时会表现出与年龄不相符的成熟，喜欢捉弄布莱克。她的故乡是龙之乡（在特别篇中是烟墨市的别称）。她很崇敬夏卡和阿戴克，把两人都看作她的“爷爷”。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"14222"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f1/f144e554e293b9f25de5dfe7b8388c255a43ebe542b2e7b99c1e20f6094f8506.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/3d/3d4fbc1101c634e117f17a8493ae59b4d8949d513bf6d85fc68bc946f4f36dea.webp","width":254,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_14223","characterName":"丹特，田都","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"14223","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"8641"},{"characterId":"14223","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"8642"}]},"originalCharacterName":"丹特，田都","characterNameSource":null,"role":"配角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"游戏中"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"天桐与伯特、寇恩一起，是三曜市道馆的道馆训练家，三曜道馆也是合众地区的第一间道馆。他会与初学者宝可梦选择水水獭的训练家对战，使用的神奇宝贝为花椰猴。训练家打败天桐后就会收到挑战徽章和招式学习器83（自我激励）。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"在主线剧情的最后，由于白露通知到三兄弟时所有事情都已结束，因此三人并没有和其他道馆训练家出现在Ｎ的城堡。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"在黑白版2中，因为被黑暗三人组打败后觉得自己不够强大，三人辞去了道馆训练家的职位，因此三曜道馆也被改建成普通的餐馆。主角可以在这里看到花椰猴、爆香猴和冷水猴的表演，猜对之后还可以获得大蘑菇。每一天，主角都可以前来这里并且与三人组中的其中一人组队对战另外二人。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"动画中"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"《神奇宝贝超级愿望》的主角。三曜道馆馆长三兄弟之一，个性谦卑有礼，对神奇宝贝的知识也很丰富，作战技术华丽，习惯以料理的形式叙述事物。由于自家道馆兼营餐厅，习惯身穿侍者服，也是个酒侍。对与神奇宝贝互动良好的小智深感兴趣，后来决定为增广见闻而出外旅行，与艾莉丝一同加入小智的旅程。在旅行中负责为小智等人料理三餐，同时也会帮忙进行对战练习。造型范本为NDS黑、白版的三曜市道馆馆长之一。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"14223"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"职业","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"14223","value":"服务生"}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c6/c622e10105225ec7c28052c8c4fc5fcd87d9c9249ca99c7da50190235eb1eab9.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/06/066325a820f941f7e0eeb1f245805b9a5a79076f30b713ee715ec3fa0677327a.webp","width":89,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_149508","characterName":"Emmet","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"149508","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"8641"},{"characterId":"149508","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"8642"}]},"originalCharacterName":"Emmet","characterNameSource":null,"role":"配角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"地下铁总控官之一（日文：サブウェイマスター クダリ，英文：Subway Boss Emmet），为《宝可梦黑·白》中对战地铁其中之一的首领，跟着他胞兄地下铁总控官北尚。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"149508"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e2/e25a72e0ad20053c4306b83d8a8dd89d98838bc7e29c814d348c92d8f348290c.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/37/3784f3a69d7c1dd7695de23abaa0bd5381268d1ac1b18000567e9a80a6c5fca8.webp","width":152,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_18984","characterName":"大帅，汉森，汉森姆","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"18984","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"170291"},{"characterId":"18984","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"170292"},{"characterId":"18984","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"60896"},{"characterId":"18984","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"60897"},{"characterId":"18984","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"8641"},{"characterId":"18984","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"8642"}]},"originalCharacterName":"大帅，汉森，汉森姆","characterNameSource":null,"role":"配角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"声 - てらそままさき"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"登場時期：DP・BW2N（ゲスト）"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"国際警察の捜査官の男性。ハンサムというのはコードネームで、番号は0321。本名は不明。初登場時に買いすぎた駅弁をおすそ分けしてくれたため、ロケット団からは「駅弁さん」あるいは「駅弁の人」と呼ばれている。現時点での手持ちポケモンは不明。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ギンガ団の動向を極秘で調査しており、エイチ湖へ向かう列車の中でサトシたちと出会う。一見気さくでおっちょこちょいだが、ポケモンを使わずに単身でギンガ団員を倒すほどの実力を持つ。変装が得意であり、ギンガ団員に変装して任務を行い、サトシたちを助けたこともある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"BW2Nではプラズマ団の調査のため、イッシュ地方を訪れる。イッシュ地方でサトシたちと対面した当初は山男に変装していた。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"18984"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/fe/fed0c51e139df5f9925138721dad4e483ee31e88e860c767d8e06954bfb03f3d.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/8c/8c184acb0a161628d4cc775e15392b87129eb2ddaf0769f8ee756845e9630161.webp","width":256,"height":192,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_43873","characterName":"希罗娜","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"43873","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"170291"},{"characterId":"43873","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"170292"},{"characterId":"43873","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"8641"},{"characterId":"43873","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"8642"}]},"originalCharacterName":"希罗娜","characterNameSource":null,"role":"客串","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"竹兰是神奥地方的冠军，首次登场于精灵宝可梦钻石珍珠版。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"游戏中"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"竹兰在钻石珍珠白金版帮忙主角来对抗银河队，在主角第一次来到百代市，主角会得到秘传技学习器01（居合斩）。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"在白金版，她会在主角打败银河百代大厦的银河队后给主角一个蛋，这个蛋能孵出波克比。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主角打败吉宪获得沼泽徽章之后，主角可以在214号道路找到她，会送主角一个秘传之药。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"她非常喜欢神话和历史，利用时间来在跟神奥地方的神兽有关联的遗迹探险和研究，她的家人住在神和镇，她暗示她小时候曾帮忙山梨博士研究。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"竹兰在心金魂银版再次出现，出现在神都遗迹。在调查阿尔宙斯，还有帝牙卢卡、帕路奇犽和骑拉帝纳的来源。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"竹兰也在黑白版出现，在春季和夏季，主角可以在小波镇的一栋别墅中与她对战，打败她之后，婉龙和嘉德丽雅会有时拜访这间房屋，在夏季，道馆训练家芦荟、小菊儿、风露和艾莉丝也会拜访房屋。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"在黑白版2中，她还会参加PWT。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"43873"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"职业","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"43873","value":"神话学者"}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/00/00f5376dcac4cb8c45dda9e72905c7d3c6a5af56dc2decf463af3d690c148202.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/3a/3a0a5c609a6619f2a13570a2efb9af38d0926266d050969903d5adfc5b245e81.webp","width":125,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_74245","characterName":"Hilda","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"74245","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"8641"},{"characterId":"74245","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"8642"}]},"originalCharacterName":"Hilda","characterNameSource":null,"role":"主角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"ゲーム開始時に女性主人公を選択すると主人公として操作できる。名前は入力する以外に選ぶ方法はなく、空白のまま決定することもできないため、デフォルトの名前は存在しない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"カノコタウンに住んでおり、チェレン・ベルとは幼馴染みである。アララギ博士から最初のポケモンとポケモン図鑑を貰い、チェレン・ベルと同時に旅に出る。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"旅の中でNと出会い、プラズマ団の計画阻止に活躍し、ストーリーのクライマックスではレシラム (ブラック) / ゼクロム (ホワイト)に認められた存在となる。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"74245"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b1/b159641c9b298d0597a2cf869c